    "sections": {
        "description": "The Aster Travel Advisor Theme is designed for creating websites with event-focused layouts and organized content sections. It includes a responsive structure that adapts to different screen sizes and supports common customization options available through the customizer. The theme provides sections for event details, schedules, announcements, image galleries, and contact information, helping present information in a clear and structured format. It supports navigation menus, featured images, widgets, and multiple page templates for building different types of pages. The layout is designed to maintain readability across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices. Integration with popular plugins is supported for extending functionality such as forms, galleries, and eCommerce features. The theme also includes options for adjusting colors, typography, header layouts, and homepage sections without editing code. Its structure is intended to keep content organized while allowing visual customization through standard settings. The overall design focuses on usability, responsive presentation, and compatibility with commonly used website features and plugins."
    },
